kanas[G]himu nante tsu[A]kareru dake yo
nani [Bm7]mo kanjizu sugoseba i no
toma[G]dou kotoba a[A]tae rarete mo
jib[Bm7]un no kokoro tada uwanosora
moshi [G]watashi kara ug[A]oku nonaraba
sube[Bm7]te kaeru nonara kuro ni suru

{start_of_chorus}
kon'na [G]jibun ni mir[A]ai wa aru no?
Kon'na [Bm7]sekai ni watashi wa iru no?
Ima [G]setsunai no? Ima[A] kanashi no?
