ayum[G]u koto sae tsuk[A]areru dake yo
hito [Bm7]no koto nado shiri mo shinai wa
kon'[G]na watashi mo kaw[A]areru nonara
      [Bm7]               N.C         [Em7] [D]
moshi kawareru no nara shiro ni naru

